# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-2, R-11). L §2.3: place = "place" ID [binds] ":" ID [CUR | ID] ["priced" price] "lives"
# lspan NL {IN "note" STR NL} (2.0: a place had no body). konto's balance is its opening carried through.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
  note "the joint account at the bank"
  note "opened in January"
ask q: bal(konto, 2026-06-30)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
=== expect
q: 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
